"use client";
/**
 * Patients & Records (source L24530–L25426, v64): domain model and services (identity, relationships and
 * representatives, consents, care team, clinical entries with provenance / amendments / entered-in-error, encounters,
 * therapy episodes, documents with versions and derivatives, correction requests, duplicate scoring and merge, audit),
 * synthetic seed, the application shell (reusing the HR & Payroll component classes), directory, registration wizard,
 * patient record, dashboard, archives, data quality, documents register, forms, settings, audit.
 *
 * Deliberate structure (ADR-04 exception, as for HR and Billing): typed imperative island filling the `.hr.pa`
 * container. The code below is the source's own text with types added; the OS integration (L25410–L25425) is
 * replaced by src/apps/patients/PatientsApp.tsx.
 *
 * Simulated as in the source (S class): roles and care-team access are a browser-side demo; every patient, document
 * and clinical entry is synthetic; no health-data host, identity verification or e-signature service is connected.
 */
